<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Asesorías en Power BI, Automatización e IA para Ejecutivos en Chile</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: #0f172a;
            --card: #0b243a;
            --accent: #10b981;
            --text: #e2e8f0;
            --muted: #cbd5e1;
        }
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: 'Inter', Arial, sans-serif;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 20% 20%, rgba(16,185,129,0.15), transparent 25%), radial-gradient(circle at 80% 0%, rgba(37,99,235,0.15), transparent 25%), var(--bg);
            color: var(--text);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        header {
            padding: 64px 20px 40px;
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 6px 12px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: rgba(16,185,129,0.15);
            color: var(--accent);
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 0.3px;
        }
        h1 {
            margin: 18px 0 12px;
            font-size: clamp(28px, 5vw, 46px);
            line-height: 1.2;
        }
        .subtitle {
            margin: 0 auto 28px;
            max-width: 820px;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 18px;
        }
        .cta {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            background: var(--accent);
            color: #0f172a;
            padding: 14px 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-decoration: none;
            box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(16,185,129,0.35);
            transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
        }
        .cta:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 16px 36px rgba(16,185,129,0.45);
        }
        main {
            padding: 0 20px 60px;
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: grid;
            gap: 28px;
        }
        section {
            background: var(--card);
            border: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.15);
            border-radius: 18px;
            padding: 24px 24px 18px;
            box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(15,23,42,0.35);
        }
        h2 {
            margin-top: 0;
            font-size: 22px;
            letter-spacing: 0.2px;
        }
        .pill {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 6px 10px;
            margin: 6px 6px 0 0;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: rgba(148,163,184,0.12);
            color: var(--muted);
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 13px;
        }
        .grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
            gap: 16px;
        }
        .card {
            padding: 16px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
            border: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.1);
        }
        .card h3 {
            margin: 0 0 6px;
            font-size: 18px;
        }
        .card p {
            margin: 0;
            color: var(--muted);
        }
        ul {
            padding-left: 18px;
            margin: 10px 0;
            color: var(--muted);
        }
        .highlight {
            color: var(--accent);
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 24px;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        @media (max-width: 640px) {
            section {
                padding: 20px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <span class="badge">Para gerentes, administradores y CEOs en Chile</span>
        <h1>Decisiones más rápidas con datos confiables y automatización inteligente</h1>
